OL,3,APound rises to its highest level since
OL,4,Athe Brexit referendum
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe value reached 86.4 on an index
OL,7,Fwhere 100 equals the value in 2005. The
OL,8,FBank will officially confirm the
OL,9,Fcalculation on Thursday.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/39
