OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AVance walks Trump tightrope with
OL,4,Ascathing election critique blaming Iran
OL,5,Awar
OL,6,
OL,7,F"The reason we lost is the war," he
OL,8,Fwrote. "The president himself said so
OL,9,Flast night."
OL,11,FIn interviews late Tuesday night and
OL,12,FWednesday, Trump had defended the war
OL,13,Fbut acknowledged that it played a
OL,14,Ffactor in Democrats flipping control of
OL,15,Fthe US House of Representatives and the
OL,16,FSenate.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/39
